        $$A_{min} = \pi (6^2 - 4^2) = \pi (36 - 16) = 20\pi$$
4.  **Calculate the difference:**
    $$\text{Difference} = A_{max} - A_{min} = 33\pi - 20\pi = 13\pi$$

